# Project convention: documentation uses Gemini

This Healthcare / Aarogya One Connect repo requires **Google Gemini** for all documentation, marketing copy, privacy/legal drafts, runbooks, and user-facing prose.

**Before writing or rewriting docs:** confirm the chat model is Google Gemini. If not, ask the user to switch models.

Full policy: see rule `documentation-gemini` (`.cursor/rules/documentation-gemini.mdc`) or globs under `docs/`, `deploy/www/`, and `*.md` runbooks.
